WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.793
If you've never seen
a Monsterverse movie...

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:05.046
If you don't know what
the excitement's all about...

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.172
Oh my God.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.132
Hoo-ah!

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:09.718
If you've been hoping to
finally get in on the action...

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:11.011
This is what we've been looking for.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.636
Check this out.

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:16.307
A few things you should
know before going in:

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:17.392
First,

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:19.436
you don't need to know
anything before going in.

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:19.936
What?

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:20.687
What do you mean?

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.313
The, uh, what's going on?

00:00:22.313 --> 00:00:22.772
Nothing?

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:23.231
Nothing.

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:23.815
Nothing!

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.608
What's Monarch?
I don't know.

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:26.735
What about all the monsters?

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.737
What about the monsters?

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.113
Oh my God!

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:31.448
Oh my God!

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:33.450
What if you don't
know much about Godzilla

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.701
or monsters in general?

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.577
The thing is,

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:36.411
you actually do.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.412
Trust me, come on.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:38.455
From cave drawings

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.790
to mythological characters
around the world,

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.543
we've been telling each
other wild monster myths since...

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.169
since...

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:46.004
since...forever.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.423
And these guys just
happen to be the latest

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.716
in that very long tradition.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:52.302
And here's the other thing:

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:53.678
This isn't a monster story.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:54.679
What are you playing at here?

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:56.848
I know we just went through
a whole thing about monsters,

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:58.183
but our show really is-

00:00:58.183 --> 00:00:59.142
a people story.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:01.061
And the things we dig
into are very human.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.771
It is your family business.

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.314
It's not our family business,

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:05.523
it's the family curse.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.942
And it happens to have
a few monsters in it.

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:11.529
Because at the end
of the day, this show-

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:12.572
is fun.

00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:14.532
Like, really fun.

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:18.286
Move!

00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:19.662
So just sit back,

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:21.289
relax,

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.084
and enjoy.

